<title>USA: PHLX to begin trading four options May 5.</title>
<headline>PHLX to begin trading four options May 5.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Thursday it would begin trading options on American Oilfield Divers Inc, Aviall Inc, Granite Construction Inc and Orbotech Ltd on May 5.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbol and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits (in number of contracts) and specialist unit.</p>
<p>Ticker     Strikes	 Exp Month   Pos Lts   Specialist</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>   7-1/2, 10,    May, Jun,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>	     12-1/2	  Aug, Nov		  Group</p>
<p>    10, 12-1/2,   May, Jun,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>	     15		Sep, Dec		  Group</p>
<p>    17-1/2, 20,   May, Jun,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>	     22-1/2	  Sep, Dec		  Group</p>
<p>  17-1/2, 20,   May, Jun,   4,500     Group One Ltd</p>
<p>	     22-1/2	  Jul, Oct</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
</text>
